# Renault 25 phase 2 five-door hatchback, 1988-1992.
#
# The phase-2 facelift of the Renault 25, on sale from June 1988 and built to
# February 1992. It is the same shell as the phase-1 car with a revised front
# and rear treatment, and was built as a variant of the phase-1 master.
#
# Dimensions 4.713 x 1.806 x 1.410 m, wheelbase 2.718 m, unchanged from phase 1.
# Source: the reference pack's notes, from the Renault 25 dimension box.
#
# What differs from phase 1: a wider and lower grille opening, reshaped
# headlamps, a painted front bumper with a revised bright insert, and at the
# rear a smoked lower lamp band, a dark bumper strip over a painted valance and
# a dark plate surround. The fastback hatch, cabin, glazing, doors, roof and
# wheels are the phase-1 master's.
#
# Shape reference: a true side elevation of a phase-2 car (only 888x479 and
# slightly soft), a front three-quarter and a rear three-quarter. The side
# elevation was used to check the master's proportions.
#
# Colours: no British-market colours were established, so the objects carry
# plain names: silver, blue, grey and red. Weights silver 3, blue 3, grey 2,
# red 2, total 10, provisional pending the central rebase.
#
# Speed 190 km/h and comfort 90/465, as the phase-1 car. Classes 2,3,4.
#
# Dates are road presence: June 1988 intro, retires staggered 2002-2005 on a
# fourteen- to seventeen-year tail.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/renault-25-phase2.blend. Interchange:
# citycars/4.5/renault-25-phase2.dae (93 objects). References:
# citycars/references/renault-25-phase2/ (gitignored; Wikimedia Commons).
#
# Accepted deviations: the inherited hatch slope is shallower than the
# photograph, and there are small gaps around the inherited glazing; both are
# carried over from the phase-1 master and left unchanged so the two cars share
# one shell. At 128 px the wider grille and the revised bumper distinguish the
# phase-2 car from the phase-1.

obj=citycar
name=Renault25Phase2(Silver)
copyright=JamesPetts

DistributionWeight=3
intro_year=1988
intro_month=6
retire_year=2005
retire_month=6
speed=190
length=3
class=2,3,4
maximum_comfortable_journey_minutes=90
maximum_tolerable_journey_minutes=465

